* TK_AIPAGE
* The full-screen toolkit, shared base: the AI line on a page (S.97 stage 1; the owner's answers of 1 Nov 2026: F6 and one menu item AI > Ask the AI on every page,
* an action offered to the model only when the page opted it in, every proposal carried out by the page's own handler).
